  "body": "Discover an exceptional brand-new freestanding home where contemporary style, quality specifications and effortless everyday living come together. Sea views create an inspiring backdrop, while three bedrooms and two-and-a-half well-appointed bathrooms provide a practical layout for modern life. Complete with a single garage and zoning for Glendowie School and Glendowie College, this inviting new build is ready to be enjoyed.\r\n\r\n• Stylish kitchen\r\n\r\n• Bosch Series 4 appliances\r\n\r\n• Built-in Bosch microwave and fridge-freezer\r\n\r\n• Waste Master\r\n\r\n• Premium Zucchetti tapware\r\n\r\n• Robertson Bathware fittings\r\n\r\n• Engineered flooring across the ground floor\r\n\r\n• Stanford 10-year warranty\r\n\r\n• One-year maintenance warranty\r\n\r\nFreestanding freedom. Quality finishes. An exceptional Glendowie address.",
